      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Fixed in `com.vrchat.base\\Editor\\VRCSDK\\Dependencies\\VRChat\\Resources\\PerceptualMipmapping\\PerceptualPostProcessor.compute`. I believe that since the texture has no alpha map, this operation writes into the red channel by mistake! Likely also compounded by DXT compression using the alpha channel?\n\nLine: `325`\n\n```\n\nfloat4 pixel = _Input[int2(x, y)];\n\nif (normalMap)\n\n    pixel.ba = 1.0f;\n\n```\n\nChanged `pixel.ba = 1.0f;` to `pixel.b = 1.0f;`",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
