  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The current script in SDK 3.10.4 ( `com.vrchat.base\\Editor\\VRCSDK\\PerceptualPostProcessor.cs` ) has issues where it is not respecting the settings defined in the texture importer (including normal map configurations), resulting in broken mip-maps for textures which invert, configure, or otherwise modify the texture channels. \n\nAttempting to fix with debugging.",
